# Grist's −2: "You may sacrifice a creature. When you do, destroy target creature or planeswalker." Bot1 sacrifices
# its own Llanowar Elves (Elves and Ornithopter together are refused: "a creature" is one) and the reflexive trigger destroys Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bayou x3
Grist, the Hunger Tide
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#1.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#1.Activate(Ability: Add {B})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#2.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#3.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Activate(Ability: sacrifice)
! Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
[T5 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
